### Search for clans
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clans?name=royale&limit=10

### Get clan by tag (replace CLAN_TAG with actual clan tag)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clans/2P8VJ8C

### Get clan members
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clans/2P8VJ8C/members

### Get clan war log
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clans/2P8VJ8C/warlog

### Get current clan war
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clans/2P8VJ8C/currentwar

### Get current river race
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clans/2P8VJ8C/currentriverrace

### Search clans with additional parameters
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clans?name=trotxans&minMembers=10&maxMembers=50&minScore=1000&limit=5
